{"type": "ModelReplied", "version": 1, "payload": {"command": {"value": "s-3bb829bf_39-0"}, "content": [{"kind": "text", "text": "- **pricing.py**:`unit_total` 计算折扣前的行总价(数量×单价)。`apply_discount` 按百分比计算折后价,百分比必须在 0 到 100 之间。注意这个函数返回的是 `price * percent / 100`,也就是折扣额,不是折后价,可能有 bug。\n- **shipping.py**:`compute_shipping_fee` 按重量、区域(local、national、overseas)和是否加急,计算一个包裹的运费。\n- **stock.py**:`restock` 先校验商品存在再增加内存库存。`reserve_stock` 扣减库存,库存不足时抛出 ValueError。\n- **orders.py**:`place_order` 加载商品、预留库存、计算折后货款和运费,返回订单明细和总价。\n- **reports.py**:`shipping_table` 对一组重量按指定区域生成纯文本运费表。"}], "stop": "END_TURN", "actualModel": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "usage": {"input": 2, "output": 306, "cacheRead": 8172, "cacheWrite": 1310}, "startedAt": "2026-11-12T18:24:28.606204Z", "firstTokenAt": "2026-11-12T18:24:31.526293Z", "options": {"provider": "claude", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "maxTokens": 64000, "toolsAllowed": true, "extra": {"thinking": {"type": "adaptive", "display": "summarized"}, "output_config": {"effort": "medium"}, "betas": ["server-side-fallback-2026-07-01"], "fallbacks": "default"}}}}
